---
const id = `inner-product-${crypto.randomUUID()}`
---
<figure data-inner-product data-original-image>
  <p>左の状態 a と右の状態 b を変えて、内積を調べましょう。左の成分だけを複素共役にしてから、対応する成分を掛けて足します。</p>
  <p class="formula">状態 = (cos(θ/2), exp(iφ) sin(θ/2))</p>
  <div class="controls">
    {['a', 'b'].map(state => <fieldset>
      <legend>{state === 'a' ? '左の状態 a' : '右の状態 b'}</legend>
      <label for={`${id}-${state}-t`}>角度 θ <span data-value={`${state}-t`}>90°</span></label>
      <input id={`${id}-${state}-t`} data-control={`${state}-t`} type="range" min="0" max="180" step="1" value="90" aria-valuetext="90 度" />
      <label for={`${id}-${state}-phi`}>相対位相 φ <span data-value={`${state}-phi`}>0°</span></label>
      <input id={`${id}-${state}-phi`} data-control={`${state}-phi`} type="range" min="-180" max="180" step="1" value="0" aria-valuetext="0 度" />
    </fieldset>)}
  </div>
  <label class="preset-label">状態の組み合わせの例：<span data-choice>a と b が |+⟩</span>
    <input data-preset type="range" min="0" max="3" step="1" value="1" aria-valuetext="a と b が |+⟩" />
  </label>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 360 330" role="img" aria-labelledby={`${id}-title`}>
    <title id={`${id}-title`}>内積の複素平面です。第1項は 0.5、第2項は 0.5、和は 1 です。</title>
    <defs>
      <marker id={`${id}-first`} viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 Z" fill="#4385BE" /></marker>
      <marker id={`${id}-second`} viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 Z" fill="#24837B" /></marker>
      <marker id={`${id}-sum`} viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 Z" fill="#100F0F" /></marker>
    </defs>
    <circle cx="180" cy="160" r="120" class="unit-circle" />
    <path d="M30 160 H330 M180 300 V20" class="axis" />
    <g class="ticks"><text x="300" y="183">1</text><text x="42" y="183">−1</text><text x="189" y="45">1</text><text x="189" y="285">−1</text><text x="164" y="181">0</text></g>
    <text x="298" y="208">実部</text><text x="194" y="22">虚部</text>
    <line data-vector="sum" x1="180" y1="160" x2="300" y2="160" stroke="#100F0F" stroke-width="5" stroke-dasharray="4 5" marker-end={`url(#${id}-sum)`} />
    <line data-vector="first" x1="180" y1="160" x2="240" y2="160" stroke="#4385BE" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end={`url(#${id}-first)`} />
    <line data-vector="second" x1="240" y1="160" x2="300" y2="160" stroke="#24837B" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end={`url(#${id}-second)`} />
    <text x="180" y="320" text-anchor="middle">円の半径は 1 です。</text>
  </svg>
  <ul class="legend">
    <li><span class="swatch first"></span>第1項 conj(a₀)b₀</li>
    <li><span class="swatch second"></span>第2項 conj(a₁)b₁</li>
    <li><span class="swatch sum"></span>和 ⟨a|b⟩（破線）</li>
  </ul>
  <div class="probability">
    <label for={`${id}-probability`}>確率 |⟨a|b⟩|² <span data-percent>100%</span></label>
    <meter id={`${id}-probability`} min="0" max="1" value="1">100%</meter>
  </div>
  <output aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">a = (0.7071, 0.7071)
b = (0.7071, 0.7071)
左の共役: conj(a₀) = 0.7071、conj(a₁) = 0.7071
第1項: conj(a₀)b₀ = 0.5
第2項: conj(a₁)b₁ = 0.5
和: ⟨a|b⟩ = 0.5 + 0.5 = 1
絶対値の2乗: |⟨a|b⟩|² = 1² + 0² = 1（100%）</output>
  <figcaption>同じ状態に位相があると、内積はどうなるでしょうか? 予想してから「状態の組み合わせの例」スライダーを「同じ状態・位相 90°」に動かし、和が 1 になることを確認しましょう。矢印は第1項の先に第2項をつなぎ、破線はその和を表します。</figcaption>
</figure>
<script>
  import { InnerProductMath as M } from './basis-inner-product-math'

  for (const root of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-inner-product]')) {
    const controls = Array.from(root.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input[data-control]'))
    const value = (name: string) => Number(controls.find(control => control.dataset.control === name)!.value)
    const preset = root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-preset]')!
    const choices = ['自由な組み合わせ', 'a と b が |+⟩', '同じ状態・位相 90°', 'a = |+⟩、b = |−⟩']
    const presets = [null, [90, 0, 90, 0], [90, 90, 90, 90], [90, 0, 90, 180]]
    function paint(selectedChoice?: number) {
      const a = M.state(value('a-t'), value('a-phi'))
      const b = M.state(value('b-t'), value('b-phi'))
      const left = [M.conj(a[0]), M.conj(a[1])]
      const first = M.mul(left[0], b[0]), second = M.mul(left[1], b[1])
      const sum = M.add(first, second)
      const probability = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, M.abs2(sum)))
      const percent = `${Number((100 * probability).toFixed(2))}%`
      const real = (n: number) => String(Number(n.toFixed(4)))
      controls.forEach(control => {
        const label = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(`[data-value="${control.dataset.control}"]`)!
        label.textContent = `${control.value}°`
        control.setAttribute('aria-valuetext', `${control.value} 度`)
      })
      const vector = (name: string, start: [number, number], end: [number, number]) => {
        const line = root.querySelector<SVGLineElement>(`[data-vector="${name}"]`)!
        for (const [attr, n] of Object.entries({x1: 180 + 120 * start[0], y1: 160 - 120 * start[1], x2: 180 + 120 * end[0], y2: 160 - 120 * end[1]})) line.setAttribute(attr, String(n))
        line.style.visibility = Math.hypot(end[0] - start[0], end[1] - start[1]) < 1e-10 ? 'hidden' : 'visible'
      }
      vector('first', [0, 0], first)
      vector('second', first, sum)
      vector('sum', [0, 0], sum)
      root.querySelector('svg title')!.textContent = `内積の複素平面です。第1項 ${M.format(first)} の先に第2項 ${M.format(second)} をつなぎます。和は ${M.format(sum)}、確率は ${percent} です。`
      root.querySelector('[data-percent]')!.textContent = percent
      const meter = root.querySelector('meter')!
      meter.value = probability
      meter.textContent = percent
      root.querySelector('output')!.textContent = [
        `a = (${M.format(a[0])}, ${M.format(a[1])})`,
        `b = (${M.format(b[0])}, ${M.format(b[1])})`,
        `左の共役: conj(a₀) = ${M.format(left[0])}、conj(a₁) = ${M.format(left[1])}`,
        `第1項: conj(a₀)b₀ = (${M.format(left[0])}) × (${M.format(b[0])}) = ${M.format(first)}`,
        `第2項: conj(a₁)b₁ = (${M.format(left[1])}) × (${M.format(b[1])}) = ${M.format(second)}`,
        `和: ⟨a|b⟩ = (${M.format(first)}) + (${M.format(second)}) = ${M.format(sum)}`,
        `絶対値の2乗: |⟨a|b⟩|² = (${real(sum[0])})² + (${real(sum[1])})² = ${real(probability)}（${percent}）`,
      ].join('\n')
      const choice = selectedChoice ?? Math.max(0, presets.findIndex(values => values?.every((n, i) => n === Number(controls[i].value))))
      preset.value = String(choice)
      preset.setAttribute('aria-valuetext', choices[choice])
      root.querySelector('[data-choice]')!.textContent = choices[choice]
    }
    controls.forEach(control => control.addEventListener('input', () => paint()))
    preset.addEventListener('input', () => {
      const choice = Number(preset.value)
      presets[choice]?.forEach((n, i) => { controls[i].value = String(n) })
      paint(choice)
    })
    paint()
  }
</script>
<style>
  figure { width:100%; max-width:600px; min-width:0; margin:24px auto; margin-inline:0 auto; color:#100F0F; background:#FFFCF0; line-height:1.7; }
  p { margin:0 0 12px; }
  .formula { overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
  .controls { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:12px; }
  fieldset { min-width:0; margin:0; padding:12px; border:1px solid #6F6E69; border-radius:6px; }
  legend { padding:0 4px; }
  label { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:space-between; gap:4px; }
  input[type="range"] { display: block; box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; min-width: 0; min-height: 44px; margin: 0; accent-color: #24837B; outline: none; }
  input[type="range"]:focus, input[type="range"]:focus-visible { outline: none; }
  input[type="range"]:focus-visible::-webkit-slider-thumb { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #24837B; }
  input[type="range"]:focus-visible::-moz-range-thumb { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #24837B; }
  .preset-label { display: block; margin: 16px 0; }
  svg { display:block; width:100%; max-width:400px; height:auto; margin:auto; margin-inline:0 auto; }
  svg text { font:14px system-ui,sans-serif; fill:#6F6E69; }
  .unit-circle { fill:none; stroke:#DAD8CE; stroke-width:2; }
  .axis { fill:none; stroke:#6F6E69; stroke-width:1.5; }
  .legend { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px 16px; list-style:none; padding:0; margin:8px 0 16px; font-size:14px; }
  .swatch { display:inline-block; width:24px; margin-right:6px; border-top:3px solid; vertical-align:middle; }
  .first { border-color:#4385BE; } .second { border-color:#24837B; } .sum { border-color:#100F0F; border-top-style:dashed; }
  meter { display:block; width:100%; height:24px; accent-color:#24837B; }
  output { display:block; white-space:pre-line; overflow-wrap:anywhere; margin:16px 0; padding:12px; border-radius:6px; background:#F2F0E5; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; line-height:1.8; }
  figcaption { font-size:14px; color:#6F6E69; line-height:1.6; }
  @media (max-width:420px) { .controls { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
</style>
